<div class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST APPLICATION</div><h1>把想法，变成下一步。</h1><p class="lead">一个小而完整的任务应用，体验 SlightPHP 的请求与响应。</p>
<div class="stats"><article><span>全部任务</span><strong>{%count($tasks)%}</strong></article><article><span>待办事项</span><strong>{%count($tasks) - $done%}</strong></article><article><span>完成进度</span><strong>{%count($tasks) ? round($done / count($tasks) * 100) : 0%}<small>%</small></strong></article></div>
{%if ($flash)%}<div class="notice" role="status">{%htmlspecialchars($flash, ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}</div>{%/if%}
<section class="panel"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>我的任务</h2><p>每一次小进展，都值得记录。</p></div><a href="/workspace/main/api" target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看 JSON ↗</a></div>
<form class="add-form" method="post" action="/workspace/main/save"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{%$csrf%}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="add"><label class="sr-only" for="title">新任务名称</label><input id="title" name="title" maxlength="80" required placeholder="接下来，你想完成什么？" autocomplete="off"><button class="primary">＋ 添加任务</button></form>
<div class="filters" aria-label="筛选任务"><button type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">全部</button><button type="button" data-filter="todo" aria-pressed="false">待完成</button><button type="button" data-filter="done" aria-pressed="false">已完成</button><label class="sr-only" for="search">搜索任务</label><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="搜索任务…"></div>
<div id="task-list">{%foreach ($tasks as $task)%}<article class="task {%$task['done'] ? 'completed' : ''%}" data-done="{%$task['done'] ? '1' : '0'%}"><form method="post" action="/workspace/main/save"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{%$csrf%}"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{%htmlspecialchars($task['id'], ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}"><button class="check" name="action" value="toggle" aria-label="{%htmlspecialchars(($task['done'] ? '标为待完成：' : '完成：') . $task['title'], ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}">{%$task['done'] ? '✓' : '○'%}</button><span class="task-title">{%htmlspecialchars($task['title'], ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}</span><span class="tag">{%$task['done'] ? '已完成' : '进行中'%}</span><button class="delete" name="action" value="delete" aria-label="{%htmlspecialchars('删除：' . $task['title'], ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}">删除</button></form></article>{%/foreach%}</div><p id="empty" class="empty" {%$tasks ? 'hidden' : ''%}>这里还没有任务。添加任务，或试试其他筛选条件。</p><p id="filter-status" class="sr-only" role="status"></p></section>
<section class="callout"><div><h3>这次点击，框架做了什么？</h3><p>表单 POST → Workspace\MainController::Save() → 校验与会话存储 → 303 跳转</p></div><a href="/lab/route/entry">探索路由 →</a></section>
